        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアケボノ",
            "enName": "Hishi Akebono",
            "jpText": "――で、最後に飾りつけしたら\r\nおっきくてボーノなケーキのできあがりだよ♪",
            "enText": "And… after a few finishing touches, your\nextra-large buono cake is all finished!♪",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3023517246128412834,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "大切なレシピをご教授いただき、\r\n感謝いたします、アケボノさん。",
            "enText": "Thank you for teaching me such a\nprecious recipe, Akebono.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 3436609282732936053,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "ところで、卵3個とは正確には\r\n何gを指しているのでしょうか？",
            "enText": "By the way, the recipe says three eggs,\nbut how many grams would that be?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 5555590045089322767,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "鶏卵は同サイズで比較しても、最大で\r\n6g程度の重量誤差がありますが……。",
            "enText": "I am assuming you mean chicken eggs, but\nthey can vary in size by up to six grams…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -1355955644137723194,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアケボノ",
            "enName": "Hishi Akebono",
            "jpText": "そうなんだ～！　でもこのレシピはグラムで\r\n書いてなかったんだよね……。",
            "enText": "Wow, really?! Unfortunately, this recipe\nwasn't written using grams, so…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 19164748297318742,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "承知しました。では、鶏卵については\r\n後ほどサイズを検証……と。",
            "enText": "Understood. I will experiment with\ndifferent sized eggs on my own.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -5452130033438605194,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアケボノ",
            "enName": "Hishi Akebono",
            "jpText": "でもでも、1番大切なのは、\r\nいーっぱい愛情を込めることだから♪",
            "enText": "Oh, oh! But the most important part of this\nrecipe is to add lots and looots of love!♪",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -1092982336720774728,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "愛情、なるほど……。",
            "enText": "Love? I see…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -2661183734703224725,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エイシンフラッシュ",
            "enName": "Eishin Flash",
            "jpText": "それで、愛情は何gほど？",
            "enText": "How many grams of love should I add?",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 6288466993041881286,
            "blockIdx": 9
        }
